Z||000000||pontiacs4me||04-26-2001||02:46 AM||||My schedule at work finally gave me an opportunity to paint my car.  The body work is almost complete, shooting for finality on friday.  Paint is due sunday, and finishing the trim monday.  Ok picture this, oxford white, with black side trim, rounded, black side mirrors, black rocker panels, black lower sections of my gt front and rear bumpers, black around the side windows, black spoiler, blacked out taillights, flushmount parking lights blacked out, shaved arrowhead emblems on the window pilars, shaved pontiac writing on the driver headlight cover, and rear fascia, shaved fiero emblem on the front fascia.  Thats about it for now.  When I get back from the power tour, Im going to start saving for my enkei rsf2's 17's, and my 1.5 inch drop springs.  Ill post some pics when I get the paint finished.  ||||reg||1
